{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clown Town is an immersive <strong>horror</strong> job simulation game. Make your way through a <strong><i>massive abandoned circus</i></strong>\u00a0throwing out as much junk as you can. But the warehouse is filled with <strong>psychotic</strong> clowns and <strong>demonic</strong> entities. Intensity amplifies as you make it deeper into the levels. Can you <strong><i>survive</i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start working a new job removing junk from an abandoned warehouse. Your goal is to throw out as much junk as you can while maintaining your sanity. Done with work early? Great! go home and enjoy your night. But there is no leaving until the job is done. Is the warehouse really abandoned? or has it become the perfect home for demonic clowns?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Intense Gameplay Mechanics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sprint through the darkness</strong> to answer phones, repair the electricity, or hold a demon child to prevent it from crying.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Terrifying Levels</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chill-inducing</strong> ambiance combined with <strong>unpredictable</strong> enemies. The levels get larger and more challenging the further you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Deep Immersion\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro</strong> graphics, minimal UI, hear your own <strong>heart beat</strong> as death approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Psychotic Clowns</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many enemies with unique behaviors, they stalk you through the darkness, whisper into your ears, and chase you at a\u00a0<strong>horrifying </strong>pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo gives you access to a few of the levels. Just a small taste of the full game. Wishlist the full game for all levels and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534660?t=1741918235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534660?t=1741918235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534660/85c827516ce252c67b0677f28c889c36b62e1ac8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741918235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534660/85c827516ce252c67b0677f28c889c36b62e1ac8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741918235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clown Town is an immersive <strong>horror</strong> job simulation game. Make your way through a <strong><i>massive abandoned circus</i></strong>\u00a0throwing out as much junk as you can. But the warehouse is filled with <strong>psychotic</strong> clowns and <strong>demonic</strong> entities. Intensity amplifies as you make it deeper into the levels. Can you <strong><i>survive</i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start working a new job removing junk from an abandoned warehouse. Your goal is to throw out as much junk as you can while maintaining your sanity. Done with work early? Great! go home and enjoy your night. But there is no leaving until the job is done. Is the warehouse really abandoned? or has it become the perfect home for demonic clowns?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Intense Gameplay Mechanics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sprint through the darkness</strong> to answer phones, repair the electricity, or hold a demon child to prevent it from crying.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Terrifying Levels</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chill-inducing</strong> ambiance combined with <strong>unpredictable</strong> enemies. The levels get larger and more challenging the further you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Deep Immersion\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro</strong> graphics, minimal UI, hear your own <strong>heart beat</strong> as death approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Psychotic Clowns</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many enemies with unique behaviors, they stalk you through the darkness, whisper into your ears, and chase you at a\u00a0<strong>horrifying </strong>pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo gives you access to a few of the levels. Just a small taste of the full game. Wishlist the full game for all levels and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["MainManMike"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3520480","name":"Clown Town"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534660/header.jpg?t=1741918235","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100559,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100559/movie480.mp4?t=1741917289","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100559/movie_max.mp4?t=1741917289"},"name":"Clown Town Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100559/9a88e0615e6d539a1f08f94f82ecb8f62b28e290/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741917289","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100559/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741917289","m